title: Dashboard › Do next › How the list is chosen and ordered
route: /dashboard
intro: What FLO puts on the Do next list, in what order, and what changes it. The rules are computed from the data in view, so a viewer limited to one site gets a list that names no case at the other site.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Any change to a request, the queue, the ledger, the clock, the EMR write-back switch or the site in view"
process p1 "FLO takes only the requests, queue items and ledger cases at the sites in view"
group gKinds "What can be on the list"
  process k1 "A request ready to sign (all four checks passed)\nOne a person signs"
  process k2 "A question from an agent on a request being prepared\n'Answer Scribe', 'Answer Packet'"
  process k3 "A payer's question with the draft answer waiting for review\nInfo requested, waiting on you"
  process k4 "A denial with a peer-to-peer deadline in the next 7 days"
  process k5 "A payer to chase\nA request in Submitted or Decision pending at least 4 hours late, or on day 5 of the CMS clock or later, with no agent already phoning"
  process k6 "An approval to write back\nOnly while write-back is on in EMR Connect"
  process k7 "An authorization that ends within 7 days, or has ended, with no request in flight to replace it"
  process k8 "Cases saved in New case that wait for a person and have no row yet\nOne line for all of them"
endgroup
process p2 "Each row gets a time\nThe due time the Authorizations queue ranks by, or the denial's deadline"
decision d1 "Is it past the CMS decision time?"
process p3 "It goes first\nOther rows are ordered by their due time, overdue first"
process p4 "Softer rows wait a little longer than a hard deadline\nA late payer by 2 days, a renewal by 1 day, a write-back by 3 days"
process p5 "Rows with the same time: ready to sign, then a payer's question, then an agent's question, then a denial, then the rest"
process p6 "The first five are shown\nThe rest stay in the table under 'Needs me today'"
screen sc "Do next card\nUp to five rows, or 'Nothing needs you right now.'"
decision d2 "Is the viewer limited to one site?"
screen ss "Only cases at that site\nA case at the other site is never named, counted or linked"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Do next › What to do now and where each button leads"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Days in state and the CMS decision time"
goto g3 "Continues in: Global shell › Ask FLO › Answers"

s1 --> p1 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| ss --> p2
d2 -->|No| p2
p1 --> k1 & k2 & k3 & k4 & k5 & k6 & k7 & k8
k1 --> p2
k2 --> p2
k3 --> p2
k4 --> p2
k5 --> p2
k6 --> p2
k7 --> p2
k8 --> p2
p2 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| p3
d1 -->|No| p4
p3 --> p5
p4 --> p5
p5 --> p6 --> sc
sc --> g1
k5 -.-> g2
sc -.-> g3
